{% extends "layout/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="dest-page-hero" id="top">

  <div class="dest-page-hero__img">
    <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="dest-page-hero__overlay"></div>

  <nav class="dest-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <div class="dest-breadcrumb__inner">
      <a href="/" class="dest-breadcrumb__link">Home</a>
      <span class="dest-breadcrumb__sep">&rsaquo;</span>
      <span class="dest-breadcrumb__current">Universal Orlando</span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="dest-page-hero__content">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">Universal Orlando</p>
    <h1 class="dest-page-hero__headline">
      Epic Universe<br>
      and <em>beyond.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="dest-page-hero__sub">
      Universal Orlando just became a completely different destination. Epic Universe opened in 2025, nearly doubling the resort's footprint. For families ready for something bigger and more thrilling, the time to go is now.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ site.links.consultation }}" class="btn btn--gold">
      Start Your Escape
    </a>
  </div>

</section>

<!-- Personal Story -->
<section class="dest-story" id="our-experience">
  <div class="dest-story__inner">

    <div class="dest-story__text reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Our Experience</p>
      <h2 class="dest-story__headline">
        A resort that grew up<br>
        <em>overnight.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        Universal Orlando has been in the middle of the most significant expansion in theme park history. Epic Universe added a full new park to the resort — and it's extraordinary. For families who've done Disney and want something different, or for groups with older kids and teenagers, Universal now deserves a multi-day itinerary in its own right.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        I'll be honest with you: it's a different energy than Disney. More thrill-focused, faster-paced, more IP-driven. Some families love it more. Some love it alongside Disney. I'll help you figure out which it is for yours — and whether you need two days or four.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        The Wizarding World alone is worth the trip for the right family. And now there's so much more around it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="dest-story__photo reveal">
      <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Universal Orlando photo coming soon"></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Insider Tips -->
<section class="dest-tips" id="tips">
  <div class="dest-tips__inner">

    <div class="dest-tips__header reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">What I've Learned</p>
      <h2 class="dest-tips__headline">
        Insider tips before<br>
        you <em>book your trip.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="dest-tips__grid">

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Park-to-Park Tickets Are Essential</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">Universal's biggest headliners — Hagrid's, Velocicoaster, the Hogwarts Express — require moving between parks. Single-park tickets leave you missing the best experiences. Always go park-to-park.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Express Pass Changes the Math</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">Unlike Disney's Lightning Lane, Universal's Express Pass is unlimited and genuinely cuts lines to almost nothing. On-site hotel guests get it included — that perk alone often justifies staying on property over nearby off-site hotels.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Epic Universe Deserves Its Own Full Day</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">The new park is enormous and extraordinarily detailed. Don't try to combine it with Islands of Adventure on the same day — you'll miss too much of both. Budget a dedicated day and enjoy it properly.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">04</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Hagrid's Is Worth Any Wait</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">Hagrid's Magical Creatures Motorbike Adventure is the best theme park ride in Florida. Full stop. Build your day around it. Rope drop it, use Early Park Admission for it, or get Express Pass — just make sure you ride it.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">05</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Early Park Admission Is the Hidden Perk</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">On-site hotel guests get into the parks an hour before general admission. That's when you ride Hagrid's and Velocicoaster with a 15-minute wait instead of 90. For thrill-seekers, this is worth more than it sounds.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">06</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">The Wizarding World Requires Two Parks</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">Hogsmeade is in Islands of Adventure. Diagon Alley is in Universal Studios. The Hogwarts Express connecting them is a park-to-park ride. This single detail trips up most first-timers — now you know before you book.</p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Gallery -->
<section class="dest-gallery" id="gallery">
  <div class="dest-gallery__inner">

    <div class="dest-gallery__header reveal">
      <h2 class="dest-gallery__headline">Our Memories</h2>
      <p class="dest-gallery__note">Photos coming soon</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dest-gallery__grid">
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Universal Orlando photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Universal Orlando photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Universal Orlando photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Universal Orlando photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Universal Orlando photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-strip.njk" %}

{% endblock %}
